== S4: BL-3 slab cost per plaquette (q-independent) vs window ==
BL-3: U_l = sigma0 on in-slice space links, cost/plaq = beta(1-Re sigma0); reproduced numbers:
  SU(2), sigma0=-1: Re tr/2 = -1 -> S_p = beta*(1-(-1)) = 5.0000
  SU(3), sigma0=e^{2pi i/3}: Re tr/3 = -0.5 -> S_p = beta*(1+0.5) = 3.7500
  (1/g^2 = 0.625 at beta=2.5 in the convention beta=2/g^2 -> 2*0.625=1.25)
window needs c0*q - kappa*q >= A ; with a q-INDEPENDENT per-plaquette cost C:
  C=1.25 gamma= 2.6320 A=3.7306 : need C - 0.5q >= A -> q <= -4.961  (nonempty only if C>A=3.7306)
